<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Office started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Office started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities said Friday it started coverage of U.S. Office Products Co with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Estimates fiscal 1998 earnings at $1.61 per share, rising to $2.10 in fiscal 1999.</p>
<p>-- Said forecasted earnings growth has upside potential.</p>
<p>-- Set price target at $42 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose one point to 27.</p>
